  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two circuits are shown in figure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. At a frequency of _______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> the average power dissipated in one cycle will be the same in both the circuits.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/30b98e53-b6e6-41d6-9f53-80bbc5cfc5d6-image.png\" style=\"width: 325px; height: 163px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "500",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For figure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>avg</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>rms</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>R</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>rms</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>rms</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">L</mi></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>L</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></math></p>",
